        <activityName xml:lang="en">Scooter, ICE, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Scooter, ICE, at regional storage
The data set reflects a scooter running 60-70km/h at max. speed, 50cc. Manufacturing in Asia. ;
Synonyms: Roller; 
UUID: 8d92179d-15f0-3767-83d8-039a4636c7a7
This data set includes all processes and materials for eScooter manufacturing, containing an ICE motor. Transport to regional storage included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Automised production of 50cc scooters
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature, manufacturer data 
Extrapolations: All values extrapolated from passenger car production. Some adaptations made for change of material.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8d92179d-15f0-3767-83d8-039a4636c7a7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
